{%- comment -%}
  Default Recovery pillar (dark layout) when no blocks configured.
{%- endcomment -%}

<article class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar--dark hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar--reverse">
  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__media">
    {% render 'hp-science-media',
      show_placeholder: true,
      placeholder_label: 'Recovery scratch assay image / animation',
      min_height: 520
    %}
  </div>

  <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__panel hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__panel--dark" style="background: #0a0a0a;">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-num">Pillar 02</p>
    <h3 class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__pillar-title" style="color: #ffffff;">Recovery</h3>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">Skin is always healing something. A breakout, a barrier stripped by actives, the small daily damage you never notice. Recovery is how fast skin closes those gaps and repairs itself before they show.</p>
    <hr class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__rule" aria-hidden="true">
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__para">The serum speeds up how quickly cells move in to close a wound. Faster migration means less time spent visibly healing, and damage that resolves before it leaves a mark.</p>
    <div class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-wrap">
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-value" style="color: #ffffff;">+74.7%*</p>
      <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__stat-label">Cell Migration · In 24 Hours</p>
    </div>
    <p class="hp-sci-results-{{ section_id }}__footnote">* Wound Healing in Normal Human Dermal Fibroblast using Scratch Assay for SKIN LONGEVITY SYSTEM 5.</p>
  </div>
</article>
